   "id": "auto-a0000006",
   "text": "When the acme-widgets nightly export runs against a freshly restored copy of the staging database, wait for the row counts in the audit table to settle before starting the diff step, because the restore job reports completion before the secondary indexes are rebuilt and the diff then reads a half built table, which looks like a mass deletion, and the follow-up cleanup job will then trust that false result and remove perfectly good rows from the reporting copy, so always confirm the index build finished first.",
   "project": "acme-widgets",
